@prefix rdf:     <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .
@prefix rdfs:    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix owl:     <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix xsd:     <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .
@prefix skos:    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#> .
@prefix dc:      <http://purl.org/dc/terms/> .
@prefix obo:     <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/> .
@prefix biolink: <https://w3id.org/biolink/vocab/> .
@prefix schema:  <http://schema.org/> .
@prefix sio:     <http://semanticscience.org/resource/> .
@prefix hcrm:    <http://www.licpathway.net/ENdb/> .
@prefix crm2pgene: <http://rdf.biogateway.eu/crm2pgene/bgw!> .
@prefix hgene:   <http://rdf.biogateway.eu/hgene/bgw!> .
@prefix assembly:<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/NCBITaxon_9606> .
@prefix nuccore: <http://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/nuccore/> .
@prefix pubmed:  <http://rdf.biogateway.eu/pubmed/bgw!> .
@prefix id_pubmed:<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PUBMED_ID_> .
@prefix id_ncbigene:<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/NCBIGENE_ID_> .
@prefix dbsuper: <http://www.ontobee.org/ontology/DBSUPER.owl#> .
@prefix crm2phen: <http://rdf.biogateway.eu/crm2phen/> .

# Example mapping
<http://rdf.biogateway.eu/crm2pgene/bgw!bgw!CRMHS00000003515--hgncsymbol!9606/TBX5> skos:exactMatch <http://rdf.biogateway.eu/hgene/bgw!bgw!TBX5> .
<http://rdf.biogateway.eu/crm2phen/bgw!CRMHS00000003515--doid!1682> skos:closeMatch obo:Disease_1682 .

